Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:03.17,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,The land of the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.17,0:00:06.69,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,There was a time, long ago, \Nwhen our country was called by that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.69,0:00:09.66,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,With the arrival of the "Amanto" \Nfrom outer space
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:12.87,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,and the Sword Ban twenty years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:15.62,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,the samurai class fell into decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:19.79,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,In such hard times, there was one man left \Nwith the spirit of the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:22.25,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,His name is Gintoki Sakata,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:25.34,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,a reckless Jack of All Trades \Nwith a sweet tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:29.38,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,Due to some rather unexpected events, I, \NShinpachi Shimura, ended up working here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:32.89,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,What sort of soul does this guy have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:38.36,Narrator,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,It's very difficult to tell. \NI think it's dim but it's definitely shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:24.71,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,Hey! Gintoki!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.71,0:02:28.75,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,Stop making excuses \Nand pay off your entire rent!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:33.26,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I fixed your VCR, remember? \NThat oughta be enough to square us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:36.28,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,Not even close! \NYou owe me for five months!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:40.03,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,And the VCR broke again, so I missed \Nan episode of Onihei Crime Story!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:41.50,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You idiot, don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:43.60,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,They'll show it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:47.90,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,Just shut your yap and give me the rent \Nlike I asked, you naturally wavy-haired oaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:48.98,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:51.61,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You don't understand the suffering \Nof people with naturally wavy hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:53.15,Secondary,OTOSE,0,0,0,,{\an8}How would I know, moron?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:54.30,Secondary,OTOSE,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}If you don't have any money,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:57.97,Secondary,OTOSE,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}then sell your liver or the family \Njewels or something, you loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:03:00.12,Secondary,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Shut up about the rent, \Nyou dirty old hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:03.75,Secondary,OTOSE,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}You're borrowing money from this dirty \Nold hag. So what does that make you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:56.06,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,They're at it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:03:00.12,Main,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,I wonder if it's a good idea \Nto continue to following this man...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:03.04,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hold on, you two. Cut it out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:20.85,Main,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,It's been worrying me lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:42.79,Main,BOSS B,0,0,0,,Hey, Inoue, you've been pretty \Nbold lately, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:50.42,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Well, I'd like to be bolder, \Nbut there are a lot of noisy folks...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:57.78,Main,BOSS B,0,0,0,,Listen. I've got something for you \Nif you slack off on your responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:04:01.51,Main,BOSS B,0,0,0,,Hold back a little. I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:06.52,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,I don't understand. What exactly \Nare you saying you got for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:10.30,Main,BOSS B,0,0,0,,Know your place, \Nyou punch-premed bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.30,0:04:13.52,Main,BOSS B,0,0,0,,Do you know what kind of \Nsituation you're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:18.66,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,I don't expect someone with a crew-cut \Nto know the joys of a punch-perm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:22.36,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,You dopes with the crew cuts \Nshould walk on the side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:24.81,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Then maybe you wouldn't get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:29.21,Main,BOSS B,0,0,0,,You bastard! You got a problem \Nwith crew-cuts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.69,0:04:32.26,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Take care of it, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:40.89,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,You're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:03.85,Main,OFFICER A,0,0,0,,What they did was pretty bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:05.33,Main,YASHICHI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:08.67,Main,YACHICHI,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens \Nto a bunch of hoods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:12.39,Main,YACHICHI,0,0,0,,But I wonder \Nwho crushed them like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:24.60,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Oh crap! JUMP comes out today!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:27.84,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I forgot, this week JUMP \Ncomes out on Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:28.98,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Should we turn back?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:32.31,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,No, forget it. We've already got \Nthe groceries to make sukiyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:36.27,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,This might be a good \Nchance to give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.27,0:05:38.86,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Reading JUMP at my age...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:44.37,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,But men are always boys \Nat heart until they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:48.12,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Please keep your embarrassing \Nemotional problems to yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:48.87,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:06:01.66,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You hit her! What're \Nyou gonna do about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:03.30,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You weren't even looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:05.21,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,D-D-Don't get worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.21,0:06:07.68,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Ch-Ch-Chill out and help me find \Na t-t-t-t-time-time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:09.31,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You chill out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.31,0:06:11.68,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It should be okay, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:16.31,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Wake up TV's astrology segment \Nsaid I'd be lucky this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:19.82,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm sure that she's \Nmiraculously unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.15,0:06:22.38,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, young lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:25.74,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Freakin' Wake-up TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:28.71,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Liars! I'm never gonna watch \Nyour stupid show again. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.71,0:06:31.25,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,But the weather lady \Nsure is pretty hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:33.65,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, how is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:35.83,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Not even twitching.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:38.84,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Crap! Gotta get her to a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.72,0:06:44.22,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hey, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:15.98,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,You guys stupid or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:18.88,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I'm not going to die just \Nfrom getting hit by scooter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.47,0:07:21.73,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,This scar's from getting \Nshot by those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:23.09,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Already closed up...see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.09,0:07:26.51,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What, do you eat glue \Nwith your meals or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.51,0:07:30.26,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Whatever.  You seem all right, \Nso we'll be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.26,0:07:31.39,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Get well soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.67,0:07:37.59,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Huh? Shinpachi, \Ndid you put on some weight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:41.11,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,How could a grown-up abandon a girl \Nwho's being hunted by the yakuza?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:44.91,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Because, I'm still a boy at heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:49.28,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Besides, in this country we don't call people \Nwho can stop a scooter with one hand "girls".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.67,0:07:51.99,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,We call them mountain gorillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:53.63,Main,MEMBER A,0,0,0,,Hey! There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:54.54,Main,MEMBER A,0,0,0,,Over heeeere--!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:57.16,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.20,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hold on! Who are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:00.42,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Demented Yakuza?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:01.54,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,What? "Fermented"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.97,0:08:04.21,Main,MEMBER B,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:14.19,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey! Who are you?! What did you do \Nwith your super strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.19,0:08:15.77,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:20.15,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I came here from a distant planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:23.15,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I heard that I could make money \Nif I came to Edo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:26.79,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,My family is real poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.91,0:08:30.09,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Furikake seasoning on rice, \Nthree meals a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:35.29,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I'd like to at least be able to eat raw \Negg and soy sauce on rice three meals a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:37.54,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,That's not much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.54,0:08:38.96,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,That's when
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.48,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,they made me an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:49.97,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Care to change your life with mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:54.55,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,If you do, you'll get sake \Nchazuke three times a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:58.73,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I heard that and jumped on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:02.31,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Why?! Shouldn't you eat three \Ndifferent kinds of meals a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:09.88,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I'm sturdy compared to earthlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:12.12,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I took their offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:15.90,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I ate sake chazuke every day. \NI was so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.05,0:09:26.02,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,But lately, my jobs \Nwent up the escalator.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:27.89,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You mean "escalated."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.89,0:09:31.87,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Finally, they told me \Nto get someone's silver balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.87,0:09:35.21,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Not "silver balls," just "balls."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:39.83,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore. \NEdo is a very scary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.83,0:09:41.23,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:43.52,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Boy, are you dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.23,0:09:50.28,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,In this country, you can't trust guys \Nwith perms and girls in red.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:55.06,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You got yourself into that world. \NYou need to get yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:09:57.27,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.27,0:09:59.50,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I wonder if JUMP is still on sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:06.29,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It's all right. Things will work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:09.55,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You want to go home, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:11.89,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.89,0:10:13.33,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.33,0:10:15.76,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I may not look it, \Nbut I'm a jack-of-all-trades.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:18.19,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I'm used to situations like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:19.56,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,A jack-of-all-trades?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:24.02,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you ask. \NSimply put, I'm a handyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:30.77,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,If you want to leave Earth, \Nyou first have to go to a terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:32.62,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,So, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.03,0:10:35.70,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,You guys idiots or what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:39.03,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,How can \Nit be so hard bringing back one girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:41.45,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,You call yourselves gangsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:44.04,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Do you think that's fitting \Nfor someone with a perm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:47.86,Main,MEMBER C,0,0,0,,But Boss, we're up against a Yato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.86,0:10:50.17,Main,MEMBER C,0,0,0,,Even all of us together \Nare no match for...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.47,0:10:53.26,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,What are you, retarded?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:54.99,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,That's why we need her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.99,0:11:01.07,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,If we use that monster girl, \Nthe Punch Perm Mob can become number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.26,0:11:08.74,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,She either works for me \Nor she's dead to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:11.98,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.45,0:11:15.99,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,She'll become a serious threat \Nif she joins a different gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:19.99,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,It's better to get rid \Nof large useless tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:29.25,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Ready? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.08,0:11:34.63,Main,MEMBER C,0,0,0,,Hey, there she is! Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:37.61,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,They're quick! \NThey found us really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.19,0:11:42.14,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,You're a useless four-eyes. That's \Nwhy I said I wanted a helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:43.26,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,A helicopter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.26,0:11:47.10,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You're the one who said that we could \Noutsmart them by going in the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:52.90,Main,MEMBER C,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:56.11,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Umm... Do you have JUMP?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:57.98,Main,WOMAN,0,0,0,,We sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:12:00.37,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:06.82,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Do you finally feel \Nlike using a helicopter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:09.38,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Well, we don't have \Nthat kind of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:13.26,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Ah! You weren't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:15.13,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Hey, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.23,0:12:31.23,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Excuse me, do you have JUMP?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:33.70,Main,MAN,0,0,0,,I have Akamaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.70,0:12:35.77,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Akamaru JUMP?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:43.06,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,This stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.06,0:12:45.95,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Now's not the time \Nfor that. Deal with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:47.13,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:48.25,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,This stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:50.62,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,JUMP...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:57.21,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,JUMP...JUMP...J-J-J...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:02.64,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,JUMP...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.77,0:13:08.23,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,JUMP!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:11.76,Main,MAN A,0,0,0,,Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.43,0:13:24.81,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,They really are persistent. How \Nlong do they plan on following us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.81,0:13:30.21,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,How did you plan on helping me when \Nyou can't even get a helicopter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.21,0:13:33.59,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,That's impossible. Even an RC \Nhelicopter would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.59,0:13:37.42,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Don't make excuses. Get us \Na helicopter, you good-for-nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:41.80,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You're getting mad at me?! \NI'm helping you. How can you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:44.27,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,You're in the way! Don't get cocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:46.10,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,If you don't have money, \Nthen give me some ideas!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.35,0:13:49.55,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What's with that?! Your absurd \Ndemands were the cause of all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:01.67,Main,MEMBER A,0,0,0,,Damn it. Where the hell did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.67,0:14:04.42,Main,MEMBER B,0,0,0,,They couldn't have gotten far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:08.87,Main,MEMBER A,0,0,0,,All right, that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:23.55,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We managed to get this far. \NAny sign of the perm boys anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:25.43,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,None. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:29.44,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,If you catch the train here, \Nyou'll go straight to the terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:31.05,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:34.60,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Gin really is heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.69,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Looking for JUMP at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:37.98,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.49,0:14:41.99,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Everyone in Edo is like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:45.20,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,They're somewhat cold \Nand indifferent towards people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:49.70,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,That's a smart way to live. \NBusybodies like you are dopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:59.30,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,In the end, idiots \Njust end up being used.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:04.39,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,But I'd rather be a dope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.39,0:15:05.84,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I really hate you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:07.08,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:10.46,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It sounded like you just said \Nsomething nasty with perfect grammar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:12.81,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I hate dorks with glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:14.85,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hey! Your personality's different!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.19,0:15:16.95,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What's with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:18.81,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I can't do this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:18.81,Secondary,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:20.14,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.76,0:15:25.87,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I are stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:30.83,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,No way! Me, too. Oh no! \NI think I'm gonna cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.25,0:15:36.31,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The train's leaving! \NAll right, then. Let's roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:44.92,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not good... \NRunning onto a train is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:48.85,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Too bad, Kagura. \NYou almost got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:50.00,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Inoue!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:54.50,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,It's terrible of you to run away without \Nsaying goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:56.65,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,After I treated you so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:59.82,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,What happened \Nto your money problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:03.94,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Are you all right? You wanna go back \Nto a furikake-on-rice lifestyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:09.45,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I'm sick of hurting people for money! \N Nothing tastes good this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:13.67,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Even furikake seasoning on rice \Ntastes good after hard, honest work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.67,0:16:17.21,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,That's funny coming from you. \NFighting's the only thing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:19.47,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Yato clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.47,0:16:20.46,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Yato clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.72,0:16:25.16,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Oh, my. You helped her \Nand didn't even know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:28.06,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,You've heard of them \Nbefore, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.06,0:16:31.47,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,The Yato, the mightiest and \Nnastiest of all the mercenary races.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.39,0:16:37.01,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,They don't look all that different from \Nhumans, but they boast phenomenal strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.01,0:16:39.20,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,They've destroyed countless planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:42.86,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,They're a warrior race \Nthat loves to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.48,0:16:45.67,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,It seems like you were hiding it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.67,0:16:49.69,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,but the proof is your translucent skin \Nand that umbrella you carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.69,0:16:53.99,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,The Yato hate sunlight, \Nso they always have their umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.99,0:16:55.87,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Hey, Kagura!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.87,0:16:59.36,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,You've covered your instincts \Nwith a paper-thin layer of morals,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:02.00,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,but you looked like you were enjoying \Nyourself when you were fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:06.00,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Deep down you for thirst blood. \NThat's your true nature, Kagura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.00,0:17:07.76,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,You're wrong! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.76,0:17:10.06,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:14.97,Main,KAGURA (mono),0,0,0,,I've traveled around the world and \Nhave come to Edo to reinvent myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:21.19,Flashbacks,BOSS A,0,0,0,,I ask you again, Kagura. There's \Nthis bad guy who's picking on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.19,0:17:23.73,Flashbacks,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Is he really a bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:25.60,Flashbacks,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:27.19,Flashbacks,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I guess I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:30.20,Flashbacks,KAGURA,0,0,0,,That's why... That's \Nwhy I was so foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:37.02,Flashbacks,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Chazuke is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:41.05,Main,KAGURA (mono),0,0,0,,I believed your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.67,0:17:42.67,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:50.08,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,You're useless to me \Nif you're not gonna fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.08,0:17:52.09,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Ciao!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.35,0:17:56.43,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,H-Hold on a second! \NHey! Station staff!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:17:59.65,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Oh, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.65,0:18:01.94,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The set-up is right out of manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.95,0:18:14.75,Main,GORILLA (mono),0,0,0,,Dreams are like trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:18.45,Main,GORILLA (mono),0,0,0,,It's more fun to climb them \Nthan to watch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:24.30,Main,GORILLA (mono),0,0,0,,And there are things you learn \Nwhen you actually climb them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:28.03,Main,GORILLA (mono),0,0,0,,I sweat a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:34.99,Main,GORILLA,0,0,0,,Fountain pens are crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.64,0:18:37.94,Main,GORILLA,0,0,0,,And it's a pain drawing \Nbackgrounds, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.81,0:18:41.20,Main,GORILLA,0,0,0,,Man! It sure is a pain to draw manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:44.62,Main,GORILLA,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, \Njust living is pain too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:47.95,Main,GORILLA,0,0,0,,I want to become a cheesecake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.70,0:18:59.20,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Oh, no way! The set-up \Nis right out of manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:09.84,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Nothing but the frigging trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.22,0:19:10.96,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Gin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:14.88,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Both of you, you'd better suck it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:16.76,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Huh? H-Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.43,0:19:19.93,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.47,0:19:23.60,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:32.94,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Wh-What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.03,Main,MEMBER A,0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.49,0:19:38.03,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I like to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:44.50,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,That is a Yato's true nature. \NI won't deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:49.20,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,But, from now on, I want to \Nfight against that nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.89,0:19:53.99,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I'm going to fight so I can change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.67,0:19:56.91,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Y-You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.91,0:19:58.97,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,All of you! Get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.89,0:20:00.60,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:01.70,Main,MEMBER A,0,0,0,,I can't do this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:03.52,Main,MEMBER A,0,0,0,,Get 'em yourself, \Nyou bad punch-permed bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.89,0:20:05.41,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:06.32,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Inoue!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:08.31,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.73,0:20:12.32,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Do you remember \Nthe first thing you told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.97,0:20:19.99,Flashbacks,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Care to change your life with mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:25.87,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,Did I say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:30.22,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Inoue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:32.63,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,There's something \NI've wanted to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:36.51,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,That afro isn't \Na good look for you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.51,0:20:39.51,Main,BOSS A,0,0,0,,This is a punch perm!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.51,0:20:41.09,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Who cares!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.15,0:20:53.44,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,There's one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:21:00.33,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,If you were gonna help us, then you should \Nhave come with us from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.33,0:21:03.95,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I don't understand you. \NAre you a shy boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:07.51,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I didn't exactly come to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.51,0:21:10.84,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I was looking for a JUMP, and \NI just happened to come to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.42,0:21:14.96,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Our lives aren't even worth 230 yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.77,0:21:21.97,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,The train's here. Get on quick \Nand don't come back, nightmare girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.97,0:21:25.07,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'd really like to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:29.02,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,but when I think about it, I don't \Nhave any money to pay my way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.02,0:21:32.23,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,So, I'm going to stay here \Na little longer and save some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:35.87,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,So, let me work for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:39.06,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Y-You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:41.32,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Why would I hire \Na girl as violent as you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.87,0:21:44.29,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.29,0:21:46.67,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Not a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.37,0:21:51.37,Main,SHINPACHI (mono),0,0,0,,So, our work got livelier yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:21:58.34,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Extra helpings?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:04.34,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,How many bowls do you think you've \Nhad? This isn't a restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.64,0:22:08.43,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,This is a place that serves drinks \Nand healthy eroticism...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.43,0:22:11.10,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,It's a snack shop. \NA haven for old men!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.55,0:22:16.32,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,If you want to eat, go to a family \Nrestaurant and order a kid's meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.32,0:22:19.93,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I have no interest in fancy food. \NPickles are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.93,0:22:22.86,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,You've sure got simple taste \Nfor such a pig!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:25.32,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,Hold up, Gintoki! \NWhat's with this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.70,0:22:27.73,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,She's already had five bowls!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.73,0:22:28.87,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,Where's she from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.27,0:22:32.76,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Five, huh? She's still got \Na lot more to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:36.38,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,All we've got left \Nat home is sugar and salt now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.71,0:22:41.15,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,What's with them? \NThey're so emaciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.38,0:22:47.31,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,Hey! You're still eating?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.31,0:22:52.38,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,Somebody stop her!
